            "datePublished": "29 Dec 2018 21:07:02 GMT",
            "about": "Recorded and fully conjured live at Ravintola Torvi, Lahti 27th of December 2018, in front of living people. Nearly 3 hours, unedited in it's entirety. This is not music that deals with \"songs\" or \"albums\", it is sculptures, clouds of sound that take form and then evaporate and never exist in the same form again. This is our silent (and sometimes loud) revolution. The sound of a tree falling when no one is watching.\nALL OF THIS IS INTENDED TO BE LISTENED AS A WHOLE WORK OF ART AND IT IS CUT ONLY BECAUSE OF THE LIMITATIONS OF BANDCAMP. Download is free, as always.",
            "credits": "released December 29, 2018\nJuho Yrjölä - percussion\nTerhi Eskelinen - vocals\nJuha Koivistoinen - bass\nCédrik Bano - guitar and effects\nJere Kilpinen - guitar and junk",
