            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "14 Oct 2017 23:10:37 GMT",
            "about": "Käki live at Oranssi, Helsinki, 13th of October, 2017. Universe may collapse but noise and drone are forever. This is just a highly compressed recording from the back of the concrete hall, if you were not there, you did not feel it as we all did. When you play loud enough, it's the silence that feels the most crushing.",
